{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Rubia","artist":"Zhou Shen & HOYO-MiX","date":"2026-08-16","sourceId":"14728071:009","sourceHash":"9ae3cfd4bf1e6608bbdc7326440191243538f8fc52f199e3ec022f8233cf4b7f","duration":200.3,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":15.618,"end":19.542,"text":"Life blooms like a flower","translation":"삶은 꽃처럼 피어나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":19.542,"end":23.042,"text":"Far away or by the road","translation":"멀리서든 길가에서든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":23.042,"end":26.091,"text":"Waiting for the one","translation":"그 한 사람을 기다려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.091,"end":29.14,"text":"To find the way back home","translation":"집으로 돌아갈 길을 찾게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":29.14,"end":31.54,"text":"Rain falls a thousand times","translation":"비는 천 번이나 내려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":31.54,"end":34.38,"text":"No footprints of come-and-go","translation":"오간 발자국은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":34.38,"end":37.82,"text":"You who once went by","translation":"한때 스쳐 간 너는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":37.82,"end":40.92,"text":"Where will you belong?","translation":"어디에 머물까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.92,"end":44.0,"text":"I feel your sigh and breath","translation":"네 한숨과 숨결이 느껴져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":44.0,"end":49.16,"text":"In the last blow of wind","translation":"마지막 바람결에","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":49.16,"end":52.7,"text":"Not yet for the story on the last page","translation":"마지막 페이지의 이야긴 아직","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":52.7,"end":55.9,"text":"It's not the end","translation":"끝이 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":55.9,"end":59.9,"text":"Life blooms like a flower","translation":"삶은 꽃처럼 피어나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":59.9,"end":63.1,"text":"Far away or by the road","translation":"멀리서든 길가에서든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":63.1,"end":66.32,"text":"Waiting for the one","translation":"그 한 사람을 기다려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":66.32,"end":69.9,"text":"To find the way back home","translation":"집으로 돌아갈 길을 찾게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":69.9,"end":73.3,"text":"Time flows across the world","translation":"시간은 세상을 가로질러 흘러","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":73.3,"end":77.75,"text":"There is always a longer way to go","translation":"가야 할 길은 늘 더 멀어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":77.75,"end":80.45,"text":"'Til I reach your arms","translation":"네 품에 닿을 때까지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":80.45,"end":84.68,"text":"A madder there for you","translation":"너를 위한 꼭두서니가 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":84.68,"end":87.887,"text":"Up against the stream","translation":"물결을 거슬러","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":87.887,"end":91.3,"text":"Waterways will join as one","translation":"물길은 하나로 만나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":91.3,"end":94.769,"text":"Tracing to the source","translation":"근원을 따라가며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":94.769,"end":97.486,"text":"No more strayed or lost","translation":"더는 헤매거나 길 잃지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":97.486,"end":100.653,"text":"You will see petals fly","translation":"꽃잎이 흩날리는 걸 보게 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":100.653,"end":104.78,"text":"When lament becomes carol","translation":"애도가 노래가 될 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":104.78,"end":108.17,"text":"Could you please hear my voice","translation":"내 목소리를 들어줄래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":108.17,"end":112.01,"text":"That hungers for a duo?","translation":"함께 부를 이를 갈망해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":112.01,"end":115.87,"text":"Life blooms like a flower","translation":"삶은 꽃처럼 피어나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":115.87,"end":120.18,"text":"Far away or by the road","translation":"멀리서든 길가에서든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":120.18,"end":122.63,"text":"Waiting for the one","translation":"그 한 사람을 기다려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":122.63,"end":126.16,"text":"To find the way back home","translation":"집으로 돌아갈 길을 찾게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":126.16,"end":129.83,"text":"Time flows across the world","t